# Generative AI Cheat Sheet — 2025 Full Edition

## 1. Overview
Generative AI (GenAI) creates **new** text, images, code, audio, and video from patterns learned in data.  
It’s used across **content creation, marketing, programming, research, and design**.

## 2. Core Concepts

| Term              | Meaning                                             | Example                       |
|-------------------|-----------------------------------------------------|-------------------------------|
| **LLM**           | Large Language Model. Generates human-like text.   | GPT-4, Claude 3, Gemini 1.5   |
| **Multimodal AI**  | Understands/creates text, images, audio, etc. simultaneously. | GPT-4o, Gemini Pro, LLaVA      |
| **Context Window** | How much text/data the AI can process at once.     | 128k–1M tokens                |
| **Autonomous AI Agents** | AI that plans & performs complex tasks with minimal input. | AutoGPT, CrewAI, Devin        |
| **Fine-tuning**    | Training a base model for a specific task/domain.   | Fine-tuning GPT-3.5 for legal writing |

